  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the initial radius $r$ and finial radius $R . \\frac{4}{3} \\pi R^3=27 \\times \\frac{4}{3} \\pi r^3 \\Rightarrow R=3 r$\n$$\nU_i=\\left(S 4 \\pi r^2\\right) \\times 27 \\quad U_f=S 4 \\pi 9 r^2\n$$\nRelative increacase $=\\left(\\frac{U_f-U_i}{U_i}\\right)=\\frac{9-27}{27}=-\\frac{18}{27}=-\\frac{2}{3}$",
    "image": null
